# Project: Personal Finance Wallet (PWA)

## Tech Stack
- Frontend: Next.js (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Lucide Icons, PWA (next-pwa / Workbox)
- Backend: Python (FastAPI), Pydantic v2, Motor (Async MongoDB)
- Database: MongoDB Atlas
- Currencies: UAH (base), USD

## Code Conventions
- Mobile-first layout optimized for fast single-handed input.
- Strict TypeScript types on frontend, Pydantic schemas on backend.
- Fast transaction entry flow (focus on UI response time < 100ms).